  The filter is off across all four SSIDs (WifiMacFilterStatus 0), which is its
  state at rest and the shape a write has to reproduce.

  Two things the architecture guessed wrong and this reply settles:
    - the cap is TEN entries per SSID (WifiMacFilterMac0..9), not 32
